## Problem classes

### `Log not mocked in unit tests`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `RuntimeException: Method d in android.util.Log not mocked` during JVM unit tests | Android framework stubs throw unless configured | Set `android.testOptions.unitTests.isReturnDefaultValues = true` in the app module. Prefer not removing `Log` from production just to satisfy tests. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Untestable Android types in resolver`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| RuntimePlan tests need a device | Resolver takes `Network` / `Context` | Pass already-classified `PhysicalLink` data class |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `advanceUntilIdle drains delays`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Debounce test: expected 0 runs after partial `advanceTimeBy`, got action already | `advanceUntilIdle()` advances virtual time until **all** delayed jobs finish | Use `runCurrent()` + exact `advanceTimeBy`; avoid `advanceUntilIdle` mid-debounce |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `AGP 9 kotlinOptions gone`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Unresolved `kotlinOptions`, or `ApplicationExtensionImpl cannot be cast to BaseExtension` | AGP 9 built-in Kotlin dropped `android.kotlinOptions`; applying `org.jetbrains.kotlin.android` cannot cast the AGP 9 extension | JVM 17 via `compileOptions` only. Do not re-add `kotlin-android`. Keep the Compose compiler plugin. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Bugfix without a regression test`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Same idle/restart bug returns after a “fixed” build | Fix lived only in a Service/JNI path with no assertion | Extract the decision (valid id, event-up, status map) into a pure function and table-test old vs new behavior |

